ourse the focus of right  is going to be on this terrorist  and to learn the right lessons but I'm  keen to focus on also the wonderful and  the best of us that was the bravery of  those ordinary Londoners who did  extraordinary things that's what we  should be celebrated and I'm hoping over  the course of the next few days and  weeks leading up to Christmas people  come to London if you're not a Londoner  come to London come and shop in our  shops come to our bars in their  restaurants borrow market around the  corner from Allen bridge you know very  well has been infected or just by  yesterday but also in 2017 they're  struggling as businesses go come and  support them that's the best way for us  to be resilient and stoic and so these  terrorists they will never win

